      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MAGIC MERLIN (1) is starting to put it all together this campaign with the two solid wins in easier company. Strong through the line with the 59kg when third over 1600m at this track from the sticky gate. Will relish the fast tempo and look for him launching late. THINK BACK (4) smart mare heading in the right direction. Sent to town second up with a game on pace sixth over 1400m at Rosehill in Highway company. Maps well and will prove hard to get past. SNITZENEGGER (9) made an even return first up over the unsuitable trip when fifth over 1280m at Muswellbrook. Can make sharp improvement today over the 1600m. Each way. NIELSEN PARK (3) savaged the line with the 59kg when he saluted as favourite over 1600m at Moree. Aaron Bullock stays aboard in a winnable race.",
